The overall project goal at Johnson-Habitat Park was to create a premier environmental education
center directly adjacent to Denver’s South Platte River. Features include an outdoor classroom, fi re
ring, overlook plaza, tent pads for children and families to experience, many for the fi rst time, the
joy of camping outdoors overnight. Additionally, there are two river access platforms for boats
