and build a fi nal plan that meets the goals of the community. Having
contributed to the early planning processes, participants are in a position
both to understand and support a project’s rationale.
Visual tools
Design is a powerful tool for establishing a shared vision. This kind of
tool illustrates the complexity of the problem and can be used to resolve
confl ict by proposing previously unexplored solutions, creating an inclusive
atmosphere of diverse ideas and building on the
knowledge base of the participants and stakeholders who know the
project best.
Our designers are able to give instant life to ideas by drawing, sketching,
and computer modeling, all the while balancing the details with the big
picture. With an existing model built for Civic Center Commons, we can
easily update design concepts to provide helpful study models for the
evaluation and refi nement of design options.
